    "blurb": "Work with archives in processes",
    "overview": "Create and extract ZIP or RAR archives in Camunda-based business processes. Zip multiple documents into one file or expand archives using FileStorage-backed storage.",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
    "mobileAppStoreId": null
  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Compress and decompress files in business processes",
    "splashDescription": "Use this connector to package multiple documents into a single compressed archive or to extract an existing archive into individual documents within a Camunda process. Create ZIP files from a list of documents when you need to bundle attachments, hand off a single file to another system, or reduce transfer size. Extract ZIP or RAR archives to turn one incoming file into a document list your process can validate, route, and store. The connector uses the FileStorage library, so you can keep files in the Camunda document store or in any storage supported by your FileStorage implementation.",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/783478/overview/img10560526788760159935.png?88a4f23ee4ba708f01ada4a5a7106bb3",
